</given-names></name><name><surname>Holden</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Rayment</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Structural consequences of reductive methylation of lysine residues in hen egg white lysozyme: An X-ray analysis at 1.8&#x000c5; resolution</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><year>1993</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>9851</fpage><lpage>9858</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8373783</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/bi00088a041</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schubot</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Waugh</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A pivotal role for reductive methylation in the <italic>de novo </italic>crystallization of a ternary complex composed of <italic>Yersinia pestis </italic>virulence factors YopN, SycN and YscB</article-title><source>Acta Cryst</source><year>2004</year><volume>D60</volume><fpage>1981</fpage><lpage>1986</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kobayashi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kubota</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsuura</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Crystallization and improvement of crystal quality for X-ray diffraction of maltooligosyl trehalose synthase by reductive methylation of lysine residues</article-title><source>Acta Cryst</source><year>1999</year><volume>55</volume><fpage>931</fpage><lpage>933</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Walter</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Meier</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Assenberg</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Au</surname><given-names>K-F</given-names></name><name><surname>Ren</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Verma</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Nettleship</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Owens</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Stuart</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Grimes</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Lysine methylation as a routine rescue strategy for protein crystallization</article-title><source>Structure</source><year>2006</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>1617</fpage><lpage>1622</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17098187</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.str.2006.09.005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>Z-J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tempel</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Ng</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Shah</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Horanyi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Habel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kataeva</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>S-H</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhou</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Praissman</surname><given-names>J</